00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:47.700
Azione 5.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.480
Allineate i framework normativi.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.120
Mappa i tuoi controlli all'EUI Act.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:52.900
Articolo 9.

